  "contentHtml": "<p>재과만톡톡에서&#160;올려드린다고&#160;한&#160;실험입니다.&#160;부족한&#160;구석이&#160;많을&#160;겁니다.^^;;&#160;&#160;</p><p>실험계획서와&#160;보고서는&#160;모두&#160;클래스룸으로&#160;받았습니다.&#160; <br><br>1.&#160;기본&#160;실험&#160;안내 <br>&#160;-&#160;이&#160;실험은&#160;비상교과서&#160;기준입니다.&#160;타교과서,&#160;수특에도&#160;실린&#160;겁니다. <br>&#160;-&#160;어떻게&#160;실험하는지는&#160;교과서&#160;자료로&#160;나온&#160;동영상&#160;틀어주면&#160;좋습니다. <br><br>2.&#160;실험설계 <br>&#160;-&#160;조편성&#160;후&#160;조작변인으로&#160;온도,&#160;pH,&#160;저해제,&#160;기질농도&#160;중&#160;1가지를&#160;택하게&#160;합니다. <br>&#160;-&#160;조별&#160;토의를&#160;통해&#160;실험계획서를&#160;작성&#160;후&#160;제출&#160; <br>&#160;-&#160;계획서&#160;토의(교실) <br><br>3.&#160;실험&#160;준비 <br>&#160;-&#160;이&#160;부분에서&#160;조교선생님의&#160;협력이&#160;필요합니다.&#160;조별로&#160;요구사항이&#160;다르거든요.&#160;첨부한&#160;엑셀파일을&#160;참조하시기&#160;바랍니다. <br>&#160; <br>4.&#160;실험실시 <br>&#160;-&#160;처음에는&#160;잘&#160;되는데,&#160;통제변인이&#160;잘&#160;통제가&#160;되지&#160;않는&#160;경향이&#160;있어서&#160;시간이&#160;갈수록&#160;이상한&#160;결과도&#160;나옵니다.&#160;그냥&#160;두었습니다.&#160;나중에&#160;피드백과정에서&#160;되짚어주기로&#160;마음&#160;먹고&#160;질문만&#160;받고&#160;즉답은&#160;피했습니다. <br><br>5.&#160;보고서&#160;제출 <br>&#160;-&#160;개인별로&#160;보고서를&#160;받았습니다.(에시&#160;참조)&#160;</p><p>- 첨부파일 평가기준은 클래스룸에서 평가하고 피드백해줄 때 부여한 채점 기준입니다.<br><br>전체적으로&#160;설계부터&#160;실험과정까지&#160;아이들에게&#160;집중력을&#160;요구하는&#160;실험이였습니다.&#160;1학기&#160;생2에서&#160;해&#160;볼만한&#160;실험이라고&#160;생각합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/051f217ee36c641d5bd5678f29a2a6ce121d2afc?download\" data-file-name=\"[비상교육] 고등_생명과학Ⅱ_2-4_탐구 활동지(1)_효소활성.hwp\" data-file-size=\"144384\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Ddglf%26dataid%3D145%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20230222221509&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F051f217ee36c641d5bd5678f29a2a6ce121d2afc')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[비상교육] 고등_생명과학Ⅱ_2-4_탐구 활동지(1)_효소활성</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">141.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a486ca1e8de825fa1ae8fa6009f39ab57ba0f9d2?download\" data-file-name=\"[탐구평가기준]효소의 작용에 영향을 미치는 요인 알아보기(교과서60쪽).xlsx\" data-file-size=\"11010\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Ddglf%26dataid%3D145%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20230222221509&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fa486ca1e8de825fa1ae8fa6009f39ab57ba0f9d2')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[탐구평가기준]효소의 작용에 영향을 미치는 요인 알아보기(교과서60쪽)</span><span class=\"type\">.xlsx</span></div><div class=\"size\">10.75KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e205f867b894ccd33c25172feb3b38e5f3a25bd?download\" data-file-name=\"실험설계및보고서에시.zip\" data-file-size=\"3930537\" data-mimetype=\"application/x-zip-compressed\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Ddglf%26dataid%3D145%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20230222221509&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4e205f867b894ccd33c25172feb3b38e5f3a25bd')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">실험설계및보고서에시</span><span class=\"type\">.zip</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.75MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/26ab45b528e7cdd2e5b780a4a6fadae564d6fc8f?download\" data-file-name=\"효소작용영향요인_준비물.xlsx\" data-file-size=\"24101\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA